75
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,100
So I tell it,

76
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:48,800
Modify this file for me.

77
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,920
He codes, and I save time. That's Symphony.

78
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:53,020
They've just swapped the entry point to a Linear board.

79
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:55,480
All I have to do is create a ticket on Linear.

80
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:57,050
