81
00:02:57,050 --> 00:03:01,769
So, I went from babysitting the agent while it writes code to just managing the project, letting the agent get to work on its own.

82
00:03:01,769 --> 00:03:04,829
So, Symphony uses a Linear board as its entry point instead.

83
00:03:04,829 --> 00:03:06,869
All I have to do is work on Linear,

84
00:03:06,869 --> 00:03:09,480
